# T-220: the acceptance journey registers/verifies/logs in two accounts
# (owner + teammate) from the test runner's single IP -- 6+ calls against
# app.middleware.rate_limit's IP-keyed auth_limit, comfortably over the
# production-appropriate 5/minute default (backend/app/core/config.py).
# Loosened here only; every other env file keeps the real default.
AUTH_RATE_LIMIT=1000/minute

